<title>NEW ZEALAND: RBNZ f/casts don't point to healthy economy - Labour.</title>
<headline>RBNZ f/casts don't point to healthy economy - Labour.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand's opposition Labour party said on Thursday that the Reserve Bank's economic forecasts painted a picture of an economy with fundamental imbalances needing urgent action.</p>
<p>Finance spokesman Michael Cullen said the current account projections were particularly worrying.</p>
</text>
